        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Yuda 11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Baadaye Kora mwana wa Ishari, mwana wa Kohathi, mwana wa Lawi, akatwaa watu pamoja na watu watatu wa ukoo wa Reubeni: Dathani na Abiramu, wana wa Eliabu, na Oni, mwana wa Pelethi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hao wote waliungwa mkono na viongozi mashuhuri 250 waliochaguliwa na jumuiya yote, wakamwasi Mose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walikusanyika mbele ya Mose na Aroni, wakawaambia, “Nyinyi mmepita kikomo! Jumuiya yote ni takatifu na kila mtu katika jumuiya hii ni mtakatifu, na Mwenyezi-Mungu yu pamoja nasi sote. Mbona sasa nyinyi mnajifanya wakuu wa jumuiya ya Mwenyezi-Mungu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose aliposikia hayo, alijitupa chini kifudifudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha akamwambia Kora na wafuasi wake, “Kesho asubuhi, Mwenyezi-Mungu ataonesha ni nani aliye wake na ni nani aliye mtakatifu, naye atakayemchagua, atamwezesha kukaribia madhabahuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, fanyeni hivi: Asubuhi, wewe pamoja na wafuasi wako, mtachukua vyetezo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mweke makaa ya moto ndani na kutia ubani juu yake, kisha mtavipeleka mbele ya Mwenyezi-Mungu. Halafu tutaona ni nani aliyechaguliwa na Mwenyezi-Mungu. Nyinyi Walawi mmepita kikomo!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose akaendelea kumwambia Kora, “Sikilizeni, enyi Walawi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Je, mnaona ni jambo dogo kwenu kwamba Mungu wa Israeli amewateua nyinyi miongoni mwa jumuiya ya Israeli, ili muweze kumkaribia, mhudumie katika hema la Mwenyezi-Mungu na kuihudumia na kuitumikia jamii yote? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amewatunukia heshima ya kuwa karibu naye, nyinyi pamoja na Walawi wenzenu wote. Sasa mnataka kunyakua hata ukuhani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo wewe na kundi lako mnamshambulia Mwenyezi-Mungu. Nyinyi mnamnungunikia Aroni, lakini ukweli ni kwamba mnanungunika dhidi ya Mungu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose alituma ujumbe kwa Dathani na Abiramu wana wa Eliabu ili waitwe, lakini wao wakasema, “Hatutakuja! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Je, ni jambo dogo kwamba umetutoa Misri, nchi inayotiririka maziwa na asali, ili uje kutuua humu jangwani? Tena, unajifanya mkuu wetu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zaidi ya hayo, hukutuleta kwenye nchi inayotiririka maziwa na asali, wala kutupatia urithi wa mashamba na mashamba ya mizabibu. Unafikiri utawafanya hawa watu kuwa vipofu? Hatutakuja!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose alikasirika mno, akamwambia Mwenyezi-Mungu “Usizikubali sadaka za watu hawa. Mimi sijachukua punda wa mtu yeyote, wala sijamdhuru mtu!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose akamwambia Kora, “Kesho usikose kuja pamoja na wafuasi wako mbele ya Mwenyezi-Mungu. Aroni pia atakuwapo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kila mmoja wenu achukue chetezo chake, na kutia ubani, kisha atakipeleka mbele ya Mwenyezi-Mungu; kwa jumla vitakuwa vyetezo 250; wewe pia na Aroni, kila mmoja atakuwa na chetezo chake.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, kila mmoja wao akachukua chetezo chake, akatia makaa ya moto na ubani, kisha wakaenda na kusimama mlangoni mwa hema la mkutano, pamoja na Mose na Aroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Kora akawakusanya watu wote pamoja, wakasimama mbele ya Mose na Aroni ambao walikuwa mlangoni mwa hema la mkutano. Ndipo utukufu wa Mwenyezi-Mungu ukawatokea watu wote! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hapo Mwenyezi-Mungu akamwambia Mose na Aroni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jitengeni na watu hawa, niwaangamize sasa hivi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Mose na Aroni wakajitupa chini kifudifudi na kusema, “Ee Mwenyezi-Mungu uliye asili ya uhai wa binadamu wote. Je, mtu mmoja akikukosea, utaikasirikia jumuiya nzima?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu akamwambia Mose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Waambie watu waondoke karibu na makao ya hema ya Kora, Dathani na Abiramu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Mose akaenda kwa Dathani na Abiramu, akifuatwa na wazee wa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alipofika, akawaambia watu, “Tafadhalini ondokeni kwenye hema za watu hawa waovu na msiguse kitu chao chochote, msije mkaangamizwa pamoja nao kwa sababu ya dhambi zao zote.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu wakaondoka kwenye makao ya Kora, Dathani na Abiramu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dathani na Abiramu wakatoka mahemani mwao na kusimama mlangoni wakiandamana na wake zao na watoto wao wote hata wale wanaonyonya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hapo Mose akawaambia watu, “Hivi ndivyo mtakavyotambua kuwa Mwenyezi-Mungu ndiye aliyenituma kufanya mambo haya yote, wala siyo kwa matakwa yangu mwenyewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu hawa wakifa kifo cha kawaida, au wakipatwa na maafa kama watu wengine, basi jueni kuwa Mwenyezi-Mungu hakunituma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Mwenyezi-Mungu akifanya jambo ambalo halijapata kutendeka, ardhi ikafunuka na kuwameza watu hawa pamoja na kila kitu chao, wakaenda kuzimu wakiwa hai, basi mtajua kuwa watu hawa wamemdharau Mwenyezi-Mungu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara tu alipomaliza kusema maneno hayo yote, ardhi chini ya Dathani na Abiramu ikafunuka ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuwameza watu hao, jamaa zao, pamoja na wafuasi wote wa Kora na mali zao zote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, wao, pamoja na vyote vilivyokuwa vyao wakashuka kuzimu hali wangali hai. Ardhi ikawafunika, wote wakatoweka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waisraeli wote wengine waliokuwa karibu waliposikia vilio vyao walikimbia wakisema, “Tukimbie, ardhi isije ikatumeza na sisi pia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Mwenyezi-Mungu akapeleka moto ukawateketeza wale watu 250 waliokwenda kufukiza ubani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baada ya hayo, Mwenyezi-Mungu akamwambia Mose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwambie Eleazari mwana wa kuhani Aroni avitoe hivyo vyetezo penye moto, akautapanye mbali moto uliomo ndani, maana vyetezo hivyo ni vitakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vimekuwa vitakatifu kwa sababu watu hawa walivileta madhabahuni pa Mwenyezi-Mungu. Basi, vichukue vyetezo vya watu hao waliouawa kwa sababu ya dhambi zao, vifuliwe kuwa vyembamba ili viwe kifuniko cha madhabahu. Hili litakuwa onyo kwa Waisraeli wote.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, kuhani Eleazari alivichukua vyetezo hivyo vya shaba ambavyo vililetwa mbele ya Mwenyezi-Mungu na wale watu walioteketezwa vikafuliwa kuwa kifuniko cha madhabahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hili lilikuwa onyo kwa Waisraeli kwamba mtu yeyote ambaye si kuhani, yaani asiye wa ukoo wa Aroni asiende madhabahuni kumfukizia Mwenyezi-Mungu ubani. La sivyo ataangamizwa kama Kora na wafuasi wake. Haya yote yalitendeka kama Mwenyezi-Mungu alivyomwambia Eleazari kwa njia ya Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kesho yake, Waisraeli wote walimnungunikia Mose na Aroni wakisema, “Mmewaua watu wa Mwenyezi-Mungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walipokusanyika mbele ya Mose na Aroni ili kutoa malalamiko yao, waligeuka kuelekea hema la mkutano, wakaona kuwa wingu limeifunika hema na utukufu wa Mwenyezi-Mungu ulikuwa umetokea hapo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose na Aroni walikwenda, wakasimama mbele ya hema la mkutano, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Mwenyezi-Mungu akamwambia Mose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jitenge na watu hawa, niwaangamize mara moja!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini wao wakajitupa chini kifudifudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose akamwambia Aroni, “Chukua chetezo chako, kitie moto na kukiweka kando ya madhabahu, kisha ukitie ubani halafu uende nacho haraka kwa watu na kuwafanyia upatanisho. Fanya haraka! Ghadhabu ya Mwenyezi-Mungu imekwisha wafikia na pigo limeanza kuwashambulia.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Aroni akafanya kama alivyoambiwa na Mose. Alichukua chetezo chake na kukimbia hadi katikati ya watu waliokuwa wamekusanyika pamoja. Alipoona kwamba pigo limekwisha anza, alitia ubani katika chetezo na kuwafanyia watu upatanisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alipofanya hivyo, pigo hilo lilikoma, naye akabaki katikati ya waliokufa na walio hai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idadi ya watu waliokufa kwa pigo ilikuwa 14,700, bila kuhesabu wale waliokufa kutokana na uasi wa Kora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pigo lilipokoma, Aroni alirudi kwa Mose mlangoni mwa hema la mkutano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
